# 15. Autonomous Remediation

Create a remediation classification.

For example:

### Level 0 — Observation

AI can investigate only.

### Level 1 — Recommendation

AI proposes remediation but does not execute.

### Level 2 — Human Approval

AI prepares remediation and waits for approval.

### Level 3 — Low-Risk Autonomous

AI can execute predefined safe actions automatically.

### Level 4 — High-Risk

Human approval is mandatory.

Define what types of actions belong in each level.

Do not allow arbitrary LLM-generated shell commands to directly modify production infrastructure.

